  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for establishing Integrated Solid Waste Management and Circular Economy in the Province of Cusco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the ecofriendly circular economic model and waste managing system of Provincial Municipality of Cusco, Establish and operate a composting pilot plant and an ecopark, campaigns for waste segregation of local households and business, Develope strategies and programs to enhance local people and tourists&apos; ecofriendly culture</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establish resource re-using cycle and decrease greenhouse gas by developing waste managing system and minimizing landfill waste in Provincial Municipality of Cusco1. &#xcfe0;&#xc2a4;&#xcf54;&#xc2dc; &#xd3d0;&#xae30;&#xbb3c; &#xd1b5;&#xd569;&#xad00;&#xb9ac;&#xccb4;&#xacc4; &#xbc0f; &#xc21c;&#xd658;&#xacbd;&#xc81c; &#xbaa8;&#xb378; &#xc218;&#xb9bd;
